	(text "v2 HOST INTERFACE (J20). Serial Modem add-on external-mcu.overlay: uart2 TXD=P0.02 RXD=P0.03 RTS=P0.06 CTS=P0.07, DTR=P0.31 (in, active-low, pull-up), RI=P0.30 (out, active-low).\nHost-view names: HOST_TX->modem RXD, HOST_RX<-modem TXD, HOST_RTS->modem CTS, HOST_CTS<-modem RTS. A-side=VIO (host 1.1-5.5 V), B-side=VDD_GPIO 3.3 V.\nVIO absent: R23 pulls VCCA<100 mV -> LXC Ioff-float, I/Os hi-Z; modem RXD/CTS/DTR fall back to internal pull-ups (idle/deasserted). HOST_nRESET: open-drain via Q1, host may only pull low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4d379d69-dcb6-4476-aa52-90d1da07821e")
	)
